+# T22 selected-band predeclaration — 11 September 2026
+
+_Written **after** the development stage and **before** any hold-out outcome was
+scored._  The characterisation stage had already been run on all eleven
+stretches; it reads only the 64 transfer-calibration windows of each stretch and
+reports no method outcome, so no hold-out outcome has been read at the time of
+writing.  Validation and the final test refuse to start without this freeze
+file.
+
+Stage-0 protocol: [`plan/T22_STAGE0_PROTOCOL_2026-09-11.md`](../plan/T22_STAGE0_PROTOCOL_2026-09-11.md)
+and [`plan/mlst_protocol_2026-09-11-t22-stage0.json`](../plan/mlst_protocol_2026-09-11-t22-stage0.json),
+sha256 `843a71742fa81872284fa73f8c22b5beda90b3a553c9d2f9ddc125ddaffe1b85`.
+Programme: [`plan/MLST_EXPERIMENT_PROGRAMME.md`](../plan/MLST_EXPERIMENT_PROGRAMME.md) §II.T22.
+
+## 1. The frozen configuration
+
+| item | value |
+|---|---|
+| selected band | **B = 9** (18 real coordinates against 350 fit windows) |
+| window / rank | 65 536 samples / rank 2 |
+| evaluation block length | 32 |
+| calibration block length | 8 |
+| **dependence verdict** | **inconclusive** |
+| endpoint | mean paired squared quadrature error difference, readout physical-amplitude units `a = 2q/sqrt(w)` |
+| estimators | zero, calibration-mean, bin read, quadrature-OF, band-PCA, band-EMPCA, Wiener, calibration shrinkage |
+| per-file bootstrap | 2000 joint circular-block replicates, seed 20260911 |
+| file-level bootstrap | 10 000 two-stage replicates, seed 20260911 |
+| multiplicity | Holm–Bonferroni step-down, familywise 0.05, over the three claims |
